&_nc_oc=AdqAbs2GzrORlchKqk6gqxqB8AoVxY11XQO7KFHMFELtYYt0fwq1dEVwtZcv7yDH9k0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFfeLr2N9KUX6bR6BCy1iKu-d3Ual8fX5VTfSQPel-kPQ&oe=6A8C27FE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dFH5euIvGW8Q7kNvwEmcUDU&_nc_oc=Adq8Gkq0suZY-o9fCbS91gIXz3c4DDBBKho4wOdRHJT1MCcDlpRvYGmGsQRLWamc-Rs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGNh5L3iR7wPTkHPPUtwxbuejV-vM3TDxxd7cXBn86cOQ&oe=6A8C38FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eOPfWxRjboAQ7kNvwEQDKY0&_nc_oc=Ado5SK8OtXGPJhoTavXvYJ-rK1z0liT8qgf77yLirkdhTLFeOXyf7B9uKbzkYj3TsZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH0r7l-0kROBVeWilHUcha6QAxjNO6Kbvl4ZGqLkTCEVQ&oe=6A8C1F47"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CzZ_8nidfroQ7kNvwHEJ8GY&_nc_oc=Adrlbd1f0swqG_SyYwftJQOEmJhcC-trs6WW7mAmerBh_2GcxjnMfTEgwk2FyIdp33Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFTqSQf_rtcYFGGp49J2-azIai8SL0wiUiJQmXgK-vw8A&oe=6A8C4355"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PSExKAnD1mUQ7kNvwFSm29_&_nc_oc=Adp1rhxsEIuLR2y9o0ovkHrHDWEs3dZUkEpZNLrG9fy4Q7qxaORqUHeLnNmgJYJSeY8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHzWcmfUg3ix0yGfs3xBKQ3AzLqgoDpgxNcSbmnQkY4Kw&oe=6A8C17A4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.